  "identity": "LIVING IRON fortress guardian, anchored on a squat dark iron plinth. Broad ash-grey armored torso shaped like a tiny castle keep, two square crenellated tower shoulders, central closed dark helm with orange visor, giant iron mitten fists. Charred cream pennant and dull copper rivets. Weighty blocky mass with a tiny officious head, no molten slime and no wheels.",
